WEBVTT

00:00:00.145 --> 00:00:06.137
Namaste. Is video mein paanch dukaanon ke ek-ek naye kaam. Jeweller ka karigar register.

00:00:06.137 --> 00:00:12.879
Clinic ka free follow-up. Repair ki estimate par grahak ki manzoori. Lab ka home collection charge.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:16.556
Aur rental mein saamaan ki photo. Sab public demo par.

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:19.120
Jewellery mein Karigar register.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:29.292
Give metal to a karigar: karigar ka naam, kya banana hai, bees gram, bayaanave pratishat ke paas ka sona, do pratishat ghatti ki chhoot, aur majoori.

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:33.866
Save. Upar dikhta hai abhi karigaron ke paas kitna shuddh sona hai.

00:00:34.721 --> 00:00:41.871
Haar aaya. Receive the piece: gehne ka wazan unnees point ek gram, aur bacha sona point do gram.

00:00:41.871 --> 00:00:51.852
App turant batata hai: ghatti point saat gram, chhoot point chaar gram, yaani karigar par point teen gram baaki, shuddh sone mein bhi.

00:00:53.325 --> 00:00:59.656
Ab clinic. Settings mein Free follow-up: saat din, aur kaunsi fees consultation hai. Save.

00:01:31.002 --> 00:01:36.326
Ye mareez paanch din pehle fees dekar gaya tha. Aaj dobara aaya.

00:01:36.326 --> 00:01:43.813
New bill par consultation jodte hi ₹0, aur likha hai kab fees di thi aur kab tak free hai.

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:51.196
Repair ki dukaan. Job kholo, estimate likha hai.

00:01:51.196 --> 00:01:57.592
Kaam shuru karne se pehle Ask for approval on WhatsApp: grahak ko ek link jaata hai.

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:16.535
Grahak link kholta hai: kitna kharcha, aage badhein? Note likhkar Yes dabaya.

00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:22.620
Dukaan ke page par turant dikhta hai: grahak ne haan kaha, kab, aur uska note.

00:02:24.289 --> 00:02:28.720
Lab mein Test catalog ke neeche Home collection charge, dedh sau rupaye.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:36.660
Ab har home-collection order mein ye apne aap judta hai, har order par badal bhi sakte ho, aur bill mein alag line mein aata hai.

00:02:41.884 --> 00:02:49.370
Aur rental. Rental ke page par Photos: grahak ki ID, jaata saamaan, aur lauta saamaan, phone ke camera se.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:55.515
ID ki photo sirf aapki dukaan dekh sakti hai. Nuksaan ka jhagda ho to photo saboot hai.

00:02:55.515 --> 00:02:57.775
Demo mein photo upload band hai.

00:03:10.061 --> 00:03:21.408
To aaj: karigar ka sona aur ghatti, clinic ka free follow-up, repair estimate par grahak ki haan, lab ka home charge, aur rental ki photo.

00:03:21.408 --> 00:03:22.312
Dhanyavaad.
